	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01r0501_trainerm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっと　いいかい！？▼
なんだか　とっても　ポケモンに
くわしそうな　そこの　キミ！▼
ぼくに　ちえを
かしてくれないか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:19:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:56:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっと　いいかい！？▼
なんだか　とっても　ポケモンに
くわしそうな　そこの　キミ！▼
ぼくに　ちえを
かしてくれないか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:19:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:18:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→
　いいえ→
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:06:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:55:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
