	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01r0501_trainerm_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうか……　しかたない▼
もし　きが　むいたら
ちえを　かしてくれよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:07:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:56:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうか……　しかたない▼
もし　きが　むいたら
ちえを　かしてくれよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T12:18:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
